WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.360
Two students.

2
00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:03.650
Two identical report cards.

3
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:06.080
Same grades, line for line.

4
00:00:06.130 --> 00:00:08.620
One grins and says: not bad!

5
00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:12.300
The other slumps and mutters: I'm useless.

6
00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:14.000
Rewind their lives.

7
00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:16.670
A calm baby and a fussy baby.

8
00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.320
A dog at the front door.

9
00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:19.750
A coach's comment.

10
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.030
A group chat.

11
00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:25.410
If the grades are the same, where
does the gap in self-esteem come from?

12
00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:28.970
In this mission, you'll find
out what self-esteem really is,

13
00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:31.630
and which of those flashbacks
could have shaped it.

14
00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.620
You'll put each suspect
to the test: the grades,

15
00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:37.940
the parents, and everything
else in those flashbacks.

16
00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:42.210
Your mission: work out where the gap
between two students with the same grades

17
00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:43.470
really comes from.
